_{S}=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe change-of-coordinates matrix from $B$ to $S$ is a matrix whose respective columns are the coordinates of the vectors of $B$ relative to the basis $S.$ \n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n{P}_{B\\to S}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, $a=7,$ $b=0,$ and $c=0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-81848/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6b973d79-8fe4-5033-8202-9693004855dc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81848"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-113115/selection/7370f4dd81bfd8eb813fd206f557e795e22ba1a5cd86372a67f07494430132a7" :answer/id #uuid "4b44fec3-903d-51b6-9963-7a0c4c18b01e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113115/selection/8ea536f98b54870dcca6a63455fcae7b67e783098bc8ba7712686c946dbc72d9" :answer/id #uuid "44866c73-d6b8-5585-a3b7-9fc4a4160cd6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113115/selection/56ff57892fb9b4bb424fc66200c672f02dcff73674bf7e564b3a443cc8bad040" :answer/id #uuid "a97b3cf7-0570-5df3-8542-d1d2fa701ff2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113115/selection/1f44cfaad37b7ec8904d56d2c1b60237a82b4c40b2dfd41aa01d638471dbbe5a" :answer/id #uuid "00441517-6673-58b4-bf45-8b7dca6cff6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113115/selection/9657ae3166cb5f6d96e41624ee223c9c6f395e267c5cbaa35fbeb806ae509f27" :answer/id #uuid "1d891238-2bc2-5e34-b253-68ecdfa47906" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 \\\\ 